narration [if clue_sekar_notebook == true]
  id: "Jangan percaya T," gue bilang pelan. Dinda ngelirik gue. "Lo pikir Tasya...?" Gue nggak tahu. Tapi Tasya tahu sesuatu.
  en: "Don't trust T," I say quietly. Dinda glances at me. "You think Tasya...?" I don't know. But Tasya knows something.
narration [if clue_sekar_notebook != true]
  id: "Tasya kemarin bilang ke gue dia nggak tahu apa-apa," kata Dinda. Suaranya pelan, tapi tangannya ngepal.
  en: "Tasya told me yesterday she doesn't know anything," Dinda says. Her voice is quiet, but her hand is a fist.

